---
title: "Feedback — CTA Retreat 2026"
description: "Tell us how the first Christian Transhumanist Retreat went, October 16–18, 2026."
layout: default
permalink: /retreat/feedback/
body_classes: retreat-page
metaRobots: "noindex, nofollow"
---

<section class="retreat-section retreat-comp retreat-sessions">
  <div class="retreat-section__inner">

    <p class="retreat-hero__eyebrow">The First Christian Transhumanist Retreat</p>
    <h1>Feedback</h1>

    <p class="retreat-comp__lede">Thank you for coming. A few honest lines help us shape the next one.
    Answer what you like; everything is optional.</p>

    <form name="retreat-feedback" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
          action="/retreat/feedback/thanks/" class="retreat-comp__form">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="retreat-feedback">
      <p hidden><label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>

      <fieldset class="retreat-sessions__choices">
        <legend>Again? Would you come to another CTA retreat?</legend>
        {%- for v in ["Yes", "Maybe", "No"] %}
        <label class="retreat-sessions__choice">
          <input type="radio" name="again" value="{{ v }}">
          <span><strong>{{ v }}</strong></span>
        </label>
        {%- endfor %}
        <p class="retreat-sessions__other">
          <label for="fb-again-why">Why, or what would make it a yes?</label>
          <input type="text" id="fb-again-why" name="again-why">
        </p>
      </fieldset>

      <p>
        <label for="fb-more">More of? What should we do more of next time?</label>
        <textarea id="fb-more" name="more-of" rows="4"></textarea>
      </p>

      <p>
        <label for="fb-less">Less of? What should we do less of, or drop?</label>
        <textarea id="fb-less" name="less-of" rows="4"></textarea>
      </p>

      <p>
        <label for="fb-other">Other: what surprised you, what you'd change, who should come next year</label>
        <textarea id="fb-other" name="other" rows="4"></textarea>
      </p>

      <p>
        <label for="fb-name">Your name <span class="retreat-comp__req">optional</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="fb-name" name="name" autocomplete="name">
      </p>

      <button type="submit" class="retreat-btn">Send it</button>
    </form>

  </div>
</section>
